  "cards": [
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Trust boundaries", "items": [
      "Tenant scope is derived from the presented API key; a client-supplied tenant is never trusted",
      "The browser holds an HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax session cookie — the server assigns its tenant, and no token reaches localStorage",
      "Requests restricted to local processing never fall back to a managed provider (live preview returns 422 LIVE_PREVIEW_LOCAL_ONLY)",
      "Large files upload straight to object storage with a one-shot presigned PUT; small ones go through the API as multipart",
      "Object keys are opaque and tenant-scoped; buckets are never public; deletion removes objects before rows"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Reliability contract", "items": [
      "Idempotent creation: Idempotency-Key plus a request fingerprint; a replay returns the original job, a conflicting reuse is refused",
      "A transactional outbox row is written with the job; the dispatcher claims rows FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED",
      "Retries live inside the workflow, so every attempt records a RETRY_WAIT transition (bounded backoff with jitter)",
      "Durable at-least-once with idempotent effects — no exactly-once promise across external providers",
      "Cancellation is checked at every activity await; a cancel during backoff ends the workflow instead of retrying"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Planned, not implemented", "items": [
      "Redis cache/coordination — today the per-tenant limiter is an in-process sliding window",
      "Amazon Transcribe and Amazon Bedrock Data Automation (spec Phase 4 and an optional evaluation)",
      "Local chunking of long audio — the offset-shift helper exists, but long audio relies on provider limits",
      "Grafana/Prometheus are shipped as dashboard and alert artifacts for an operator-owned stack, not deployed here"
    ] },
    { "dot": "slate", "title": "Evidence", "items": [
      "Every component cites repository paths at revision 2b44b8d (git@github.com:Abdul-Jaweed/stt-platform.git)",
      "Implemented vs planned is stated per node: a 'planned — not implemented' tag means the repository does not contain it",
      "Diagram validation proves the drawing is well-formed, not that the platform runs",
      "Live scope verified elsewhere: 469 backend tests + 3 GPU, 156 frontend tests, one live call per managed provider"
    ] }
  ]
